WEBVTT

01:26.789 --> 01:29.789
[Glory]

01:30.650 --> 01:32.910
[Episode 29]

01:36.120 --> 01:36.920
Young Master.

01:39.039 --> 01:39.840
Young Master,

01:40.200 --> 01:40.640
the doctor said

01:40.640 --> 01:41.920
you must rest in bed.

01:42.039 --> 01:43.509
Be careful not
to tear your wound open again.

01:43.509 --> 01:44.970
Where are you trying to go?

01:45.009 --> 01:45.840
I'm fine.

01:52.150 --> 01:52.840
Mr. Yan.

01:57.710 --> 01:59.150
Do you have something urgent

01:59.150 --> 02:00.480
that you must go out for?

02:01.460 --> 02:03.710
Shixin, you may leave.

02:06.760 --> 02:08.680
Xiu Qiong, you may go too.

02:14.030 --> 02:14.800
Mr. Yan,

02:15.710 --> 02:17.240
what do you have to say to me?

02:20.520 --> 02:22.120
Don't take Lady Rong's words

02:22.470 --> 02:23.710
to heart.

02:24.680 --> 02:27.360
Our engagement doesn't count anyway.

02:28.310 --> 02:29.870
You don't want to marry me?

02:32.230 --> 02:32.920
I don't.

02:35.240 --> 02:36.770
The Yan family sent you here

02:37.240 --> 02:39.700
to form a marriage alliance
with our family.

02:39.750 --> 02:41.810
Grandmother kept you here for so long

02:41.870 --> 02:43.710
not only to assess your character,

02:43.710 --> 02:44.970
but more importantly,

02:45.150 --> 02:47.680
to strengthen the alliance
with your family.

02:47.840 --> 02:49.079
If you don't favor me,

02:49.840 --> 02:50.680
then which young lady

02:50.680 --> 02:52.340
from our family do you prefer?

02:52.360 --> 02:53.820
I'll speak to Grandmother for you.

02:53.820 --> 02:54.540
No.

02:56.520 --> 02:57.240
I don't.

02:59.150 --> 03:00.910
You deny everything,

03:01.840 --> 03:03.370
so what exactly do you want?

03:07.150 --> 03:08.590
My feelings for you

03:09.430 --> 03:10.690
are clear to Lady Rong.

03:11.360 --> 03:12.360
Everyone in your family

03:12.360 --> 03:13.560
can see it clearly.

03:14.630 --> 03:15.960
Could it be that only you

03:15.960 --> 03:16.620
don't know?

03:17.630 --> 03:18.430
You know.

03:19.360 --> 03:20.560
You've always known.

03:23.120 --> 03:24.579
What are you trying to say?

03:27.240 --> 03:29.500
Why ask when you already know the answer?

03:31.360 --> 03:32.710
You agreed to marry me,

03:34.000 --> 03:36.120
was it because
I risked my life to save you,

03:36.120 --> 03:36.800
or...

03:37.800 --> 03:39.530
because of Lady Rong's orders?

03:42.630 --> 03:43.760
Don't say anything.

03:47.460 --> 03:48.590
I don't want to know.

03:51.190 --> 03:52.720
Mr. Yan, you're perceptive

03:53.180 --> 03:54.780
and understand everything.

03:55.040 --> 03:57.760
Some things need not be spoken aloud.

03:58.870 --> 04:00.280
Since you are reluctant,

04:00.870 --> 04:03.120
I'll speak to Grandmother on your behalf.

04:03.120 --> 04:05.720
I'm sure she won't force you
against your will.

04:11.020 --> 04:13.530
Rong Shanbao, how can you be so cruel?

04:14.240 --> 04:16.040
Can't you just humor me a little?

04:17.740 --> 04:19.070
If you would just tell me

04:20.160 --> 04:21.160
that you accept me

04:21.800 --> 04:22.390
not because of

04:22.390 --> 04:23.870
the alliance between our families,

04:23.870 --> 04:24.560
nor because of

04:24.560 --> 04:25.820
Lady Rong's pressure,

04:26.430 --> 04:28.950
but because I've touched your heart

04:29.870 --> 04:32.000
and you're willing to give me a chance,

04:32.240 --> 04:33.640
that would make me happy.

04:35.950 --> 04:37.610
Lady Rong was actually wrong.

04:39.240 --> 04:40.700
I'm not that magnanimous,

04:41.920 --> 04:43.180
nor am I that tolerant.

04:51.430 --> 04:53.159
From the first moment I saw you,

04:54.630 --> 04:55.630
I fell for you,

04:56.630 --> 04:59.030
wanting to be the master
of the Rong family.

04:59.040 --> 05:00.840
But I know who you truly care for.

05:02.070 --> 05:03.800
I've known from the beginning.

05:05.500 --> 05:07.060
You're so cold and aloof

05:08.270 --> 05:09.430
to everyone else,

05:11.070 --> 05:13.120
only treating him differently.

05:13.630 --> 05:15.690
But he's calculating and ambitious.

05:16.240 --> 05:16.870
His sincerity

05:16.870 --> 05:18.920
is always mixed with ulterior motives.

05:18.920 --> 05:20.480
He has designs on you,

05:20.480 --> 05:21.360
but I don't.

05:23.460 --> 05:24.860
I don't ask for your love,

05:26.190 --> 05:27.430
nor your pity.

05:30.000 --> 05:31.730
I only wish for your happiness.

05:33.409 --> 05:35.070
But he ultimately failed you.

05:36.680 --> 05:38.010
He doesn't deserve you.

05:39.310 --> 05:40.570
He's not worthy of you.

05:44.159 --> 05:44.720
Yes.

05:46.270 --> 05:48.070
Lu Jianglai kept things from me.

05:48.800 --> 05:50.130
What about you, Mr. Yan?

05:51.190 --> 05:53.520
Have you ever deceived me about anything?

06:02.830 --> 06:03.560
No.

06:05.720 --> 06:06.920
Not a single thing.

06:08.950 --> 06:09.950
I understand now.

06:11.230 --> 06:13.560
You don't want
to break off our engagement—

06:13.560 --> 06:15.290
you're asking me for a promise.

06:15.800 --> 06:16.360
Yes.

06:17.390 --> 06:18.360
I want you to say

06:19.510 --> 06:20.600
that after we're married,

06:20.600 --> 06:21.930
you won't see him again.

06:22.850 --> 06:24.050
Even if you do see him,

06:24.970 --> 06:26.500
you won't acknowledge him.

06:28.160 --> 06:29.360
After we're married?

06:29.920 --> 06:30.680
Say it.

06:36.430 --> 06:37.290
Lie down first.

06:37.510 --> 06:38.710
I'll call the doctor.

06:40.830 --> 06:41.720
I want you to say

06:42.510 --> 06:43.640
that you promise me.

06:45.030 --> 06:45.960
It's not like...

06:47.390 --> 06:48.250
I have a choice.

06:49.550 --> 06:51.610
A marriage arranged by Grandmother—

06:51.630 --> 06:52.690
if  I dare to refuse,

06:53.560 --> 06:55.960
she'll just cast me out
of the family again.

07:08.360 --> 07:09.120
Shixin.

07:11.630 --> 07:12.430
Lady Shanbao.

07:12.480 --> 07:13.510
Send for Dr. Sun.

07:24.520 --> 07:25.320
I understand.

07:26.920 --> 07:28.650
It's just there are some things

07:28.720 --> 07:30.520
I still need to clarify with him.

07:32.120 --> 07:32.800
Alright.

07:34.540 --> 07:36.140
Stay with me a little longer.

08:12.430 --> 08:13.160
Lady Yunxi.

08:14.240 --> 08:15.000
Yunxi,

08:15.270 --> 08:16.070
I heard

08:16.150 --> 08:18.150
you want to keep him at Rong Mansion.

08:21.910 --> 08:23.440
Yes, Grandmother.

08:31.620 --> 08:32.299
Nonsense!

08:33.720 --> 08:35.480
I can tolerate Li only because

08:35.840 --> 08:37.169
she carries Rong blood.

08:37.390 --> 08:38.600
What is he anyway?

08:39.200 --> 08:41.730
He'll just tarnish
our family's reputation.

08:41.789 --> 08:42.440
Yunxi,

08:43.100 --> 08:43.620
you're

08:43.640 --> 08:45.440
disappointing me more and more.

08:46.870 --> 08:47.480
Lady Rong.

08:50.440 --> 08:51.240
Grandmother,

08:53.270 --> 08:55.200
what I feared most since childhood

08:56.660 --> 08:59.060
was hearing you say
the word "disappoint."

09:04.490 --> 09:05.810
Because of it,

09:06.670 --> 09:08.270
I practiced tea arts relentlessly

09:08.270 --> 09:09.390
through freezing winters
and scorching summers,

09:09.390 --> 09:11.520
never daring to slack off for a moment.

09:11.550 --> 09:12.870
Because of it,

09:13.800 --> 09:15.960
I let two people who truly cared for me

09:16.200 --> 09:18.800
live in hiding,
concealing their identities,

09:19.670 --> 09:20.870
just so I could become

09:20.870 --> 09:22.670
a worthy whetstone in your eyes.

09:22.960 --> 09:23.870
In your eyes,

09:24.380 --> 09:26.550
only the power of the Rong family matters,

09:26.550 --> 09:28.810
and you've tried to mold us all into that.

09:29.780 --> 09:32.630
I've obediently followed your words
for over a decade,

09:32.630 --> 09:34.200
and only now dare I ask,

09:36.290 --> 09:37.320
is this right?

09:37.630 --> 09:38.390
Well!

09:39.580 --> 09:40.710
For the sake of a man,

09:41.270 --> 09:43.600
you dare talk back
to your own grandmother!

09:43.600 --> 09:45.670
Have all the filial piety and rules
you've learned

09:45.670 --> 09:47.320
been thrown to the winds?

09:47.390 --> 09:48.750
Li is only three years old,

09:48.750 --> 09:50.550
yet she can tell right from wrong,

09:50.550 --> 09:52.240
and knows family matters most.

09:52.240 --> 09:54.270
An Cha, despite being physically weak,

09:54.270 --> 09:55.720
managed to escort Li back

09:55.840 --> 09:56.840
from the Provincial Governor's Office

09:56.840 --> 09:58.030
on his own.

09:59.200 --> 10:01.750
Grandmother, I used to listen to you

10:02.200 --> 10:03.600
to fight for power.

10:04.270 --> 10:05.390
But in the end,

10:06.720 --> 10:07.910
I found myself with nothing

10:07.910 --> 10:09.000
by my side.

10:10.390 --> 10:11.600
You've used me

10:12.720 --> 10:14.390
for so many years,

10:15.910 --> 10:17.550
yet you never truly cared about

10:17.550 --> 10:19.840
what I like or what I'm good at.

10:21.720 --> 10:22.390
Now,

10:23.510 --> 10:26.230
it's time to let go
and allow me to make my own choice.

10:26.230 --> 10:26.710
You...

10:34.080 --> 10:34.750
Get up.

10:41.840 --> 10:42.630
Rong Yunxi!

10:44.200 --> 10:45.200
Think carefully.

10:45.900 --> 10:47.300
If you dare keep him here,

10:47.790 --> 10:49.600
you'll never get a share

10:50.320 --> 10:52.980
of the Rong family's
tea plantations and shops.

11:09.230 --> 11:11.070
♪ The sky so vast ♪

11:11.100 --> 11:16.160
♪ Clouds over the wilds drift far away ♪

11:16.250 --> 11:17.970
♪ The plains stretch wide and free ♪

11:18.000 --> 11:23.070
♪ Playing with snow, stroking grass,
touched by frost's glee ♪

11:23.330 --> 11:25.220
♪ Hatred stretches far and wide ♪

11:24.480 --> 11:25.390
I've made my choice.

11:25.250 --> 11:31.370
♪ One song severs the road to the ends
of the earth, nowhere to hide ♪

11:32.010 --> 11:37.110
♪ Could it be concealed
in the moonlight? ♪

11:46.440 --> 11:48.270
This looks good.

11:49.390 --> 11:50.560
Do we hang one here too?

11:50.560 --> 11:51.320
Yes.

11:51.390 --> 11:52.240
Hang one here as well.

11:52.240 --> 11:52.720
Okay.

11:52.960 --> 11:54.160
Take this over there.

11:54.480 --> 11:54.960
Hurry up.

11:54.960 --> 11:55.630
Help me lift this.

11:55.630 --> 11:56.160
Alright.

11:57.380 --> 12:00.340
[Rong's Ancestral Temple]

11:57.600 --> 11:58.730
That's about right.

11:58.880 --> 11:59.590
No problem.

11:59.610 --> 12:00.490
Be careful.

12:01.320 --> 12:02.670
Alright, I'm hanging it now.

12:02.670 --> 12:03.150
Good.

12:25.670 --> 12:27.150
What are you sneaking around for?

12:27.150 --> 12:27.790
Come in.

12:37.390 --> 12:38.030
My Lord.

12:38.630 --> 12:41.080
What? I gave you ten strokes

12:41.320 --> 12:43.050
for withholding information,

12:43.200 --> 12:45.400
and now your master feels sorry for you?

12:46.630 --> 12:48.600
What message did you actually bring?

12:48.600 --> 12:50.000
Why hesitate to speak?

12:50.480 --> 12:52.360
My Lord, I went to the Rong Mansion

12:52.790 --> 12:53.480
and didn't see Lady Shanbao.

12:53.480 --> 12:55.140
She was at the tea plantation.

12:55.350 --> 12:57.600
But the Rong Mansion
is decorating for celebration.

12:57.600 --> 12:58.260
They're...

12:59.550 --> 13:00.950
preparing for a wedding.

13:01.710 --> 13:06.640
♪ Who tears a strand
of light from the dark night? ♪

13:02.210 --> 13:03.140
What did you say?

13:04.440 --> 13:04.960
My Lord,

13:05.510 --> 13:08.500
the Rong and Yan families
are to be united by marriage.

13:08.500 --> 13:13.500
♪ It jolts my already silent heart
awake ♪

13:15.230 --> 13:20.000
♪ The moon hangs bright,
as breezes dance among stars ♪

13:20.620 --> 13:26.450
♪ Hear the sighs
for the beauty's fleeting years ♪

13:27.330 --> 13:33.370
♪ Lost in the mortal world,
it fades into twilight ♪

13:33.880 --> 13:39.910
♪ Grass sprouts, orioles sing,
longevity slips away ♪

13:35.510 --> 13:36.080
My lord.

13:37.200 --> 13:37.750
My lord!

13:40.590 --> 13:46.510
♪ Love comes in scattered pairs,
yet thoughts linger on ♪

13:46.530 --> 13:53.000
♪ Drifting with the passing years ♪

13:53.430 --> 13:56.780
♪ Flowers bloom and wither,
the sun climbs and falls ♪

13:56.820 --> 13:59.990
♪ True feelings are like drifting mist ♪

14:00.280 --> 14:02.530
♪ People only know loneliness ♪

14:02.570 --> 14:06.640
♪ Who cares about karma's twist? ♪

14:06.820 --> 14:10.390
♪ Tides ebb and flow,
the moon swells and shrinks ♪

14:10.410 --> 14:13.430
♪ I see through, yet hold my tongue ♪

14:13.500 --> 14:19.770
♪ Too fragile to be put into words ♪

14:20.220 --> 14:23.570
♪ Flowers bloom and wither,
the sun climbs and falls ♪

14:23.610 --> 14:26.780
♪ True feelings are like drifting mist ♪

14:27.080 --> 14:29.320
♪ People only know loneliness ♪

14:29.360 --> 14:33.430
♪ Who cares about karma's twist? ♪

14:33.610 --> 14:37.180
♪ Tides ebb and flow,
the moon swells and shrinks ♪

14:37.200 --> 14:40.220
♪ I see through, yet hold my tongue ♪

14:40.290 --> 14:46.560
♪ Too fragile to be put into words ♪

14:46.320 --> 14:46.990
Lady Shanbao,

14:46.990 --> 14:53.260
♪ Too fragile to be put into words ♪

14:47.360 --> 14:49.360
the tea trees in this area are quite weak.

14:49.360 --> 14:50.080
I've already instructed the workers

14:50.080 --> 14:51.440
to take special care of them.

14:51.440 --> 14:52.440
But last night's strong wind

14:52.440 --> 14:53.840
knocked them over again.

15:06.550 --> 15:07.840
Tomorrow, go down the mountain

15:07.840 --> 15:09.240
and bring back some soil.

15:10.360 --> 15:12.490
Why bring soil from down the mountain?

15:13.120 --> 15:14.480
The elevation here is too high,

15:14.480 --> 15:16.080
and the soil is mostly sandy.

15:16.200 --> 15:18.030
This summer's constant heavy rains

15:18.030 --> 15:19.670
have loosened the tea tree roots.

15:19.670 --> 15:21.320
Replacing it with better soil from below

15:21.320 --> 15:23.720
will help the tea trees
secure their roots.

15:28.360 --> 15:29.160
Lady Shanbao.

15:31.150 --> 15:32.550
May I have a word with you?

15:35.000 --> 15:35.720
Yi,

15:36.410 --> 15:37.960
take Lady Yunyin ahead

15:38.730 --> 15:40.510
and check if there are any oversights
in the frost protection.

15:40.510 --> 15:41.030
Yes.

16:02.390 --> 16:04.650
Rong Shanbao, you've deceived me again.

16:07.720 --> 16:08.520
Deceived you?

16:09.840 --> 16:11.030
How have I deceived you?

16:11.030 --> 16:12.240
You said that once the case was settled,

16:12.240 --> 16:13.770
you would give me an answer.

16:13.840 --> 16:15.150
I've waited for you all this time,

16:15.150 --> 16:16.480
and this is your answer?

16:18.200 --> 16:19.330
So you already know.

16:19.340 --> 16:20.150
Answer me!

16:21.630 --> 16:22.440
Lord Lu, I thought you were

16:22.440 --> 16:23.360
a clever man

16:23.910 --> 16:25.000
who'd know how to pursue benefits
and avoid harm

16:25.000 --> 16:25.960
when making choices.

16:25.960 --> 16:27.390
-I don't need to…
-You lied to me.

16:27.390 --> 16:28.270
You never intended

16:28.270 --> 16:29.390
to reconcile with me.

16:29.390 --> 16:31.000
You're going to marry someone else.

16:31.000 --> 16:33.200
Women of the Rong family do not marry out.

16:33.200 --> 16:34.850
Whether you marry out
or take a husband in,

16:34.850 --> 16:35.510
you'll keep him

16:35.510 --> 16:36.390
by your side

16:36.550 --> 16:38.010
to completely replace me.

16:38.360 --> 16:39.360
Isn't that right?

16:39.670 --> 16:40.600
I'm marrying him

16:41.270 --> 16:41.790
only for

16:41.790 --> 16:43.080
the alliance between
the Rong and Yan families,

16:43.080 --> 16:44.510
for the new tea route in the Shu region,

16:44.510 --> 16:46.240
and for Grandmother's orders.

16:47.700 --> 16:49.160
You have feelings for him?

16:51.420 --> 16:51.940
Let go.

16:51.960 --> 16:52.680
I won't!

16:54.240 --> 16:54.790
It's true

16:55.320 --> 16:55.750
that I previously

16:55.750 --> 16:56.790
entered the Rong family
to investigate the case,

16:56.790 --> 16:57.960
but I know I was wrong.

16:57.960 --> 16:58.720
From now on, I will never

16:58.720 --> 16:59.510
deceive you again.

16:59.510 --> 17:00.390
Never again.

17:01.080 --> 17:02.270
You clearly love me,

17:02.600 --> 17:03.960
so why marry Yan Bailou?

17:04.880 --> 17:06.069
I've told you already.

17:06.069 --> 17:07.130
I don't believe it.

17:08.270 --> 17:08.829
You, Rong Shanbao,

17:08.829 --> 17:10.339
would never be easily manipulated

17:10.339 --> 17:12.349
nor would you change your mind
without reason.

17:12.349 --> 17:13.069
Tell me,

17:13.750 --> 17:15.280
you must have your reasons,

17:15.510 --> 17:16.200
don't you?

17:16.750 --> 17:18.589
Don't you understand what I'm saying?

17:18.589 --> 17:19.650
I told you to let go!

17:24.560 --> 17:29.220
♪ Get caught in a heavy, wild snowfall ♪

17:29.300 --> 17:33.030
♪ Watch magpies fluttering past my eyes ♪

17:33.230 --> 17:37.390
♪ It's tormenting itself all alone ♪

17:37.610 --> 17:41.710
♪ Unable to find any peers
for a get-together ♪

17:38.070 --> 17:39.070
You want reasons?

17:39.680 --> 17:41.640
Fine, I'll tell you.

17:42.060 --> 17:46.220
♪ Wait for a perfectly full moon ♪

17:42.310 --> 17:43.030
Men in the Rong family

17:43.030 --> 17:45.070
are all gentle and obedient.

17:45.350 --> 17:46.480
I've never seen anyone like you,

17:46.230 --> 17:50.530
♪ Yet every slice of it seems incomplete ♪

17:46.480 --> 17:48.110
so defiant and calculating.

17:48.590 --> 17:50.510
What the Rong women fear most

17:50.510 --> 17:51.720
are ambitious men.

17:50.560 --> 17:54.530
♪ Is it because my prayers
are too presumptuous? ♪

17:52.200 --> 17:53.830
The heir especially cannot

17:53.830 --> 17:54.880
be easily influenced by men.

17:54.770 --> 17:59.540
♪ Or do I lack a bit
of the sacrificial blood? ♪

17:55.310 --> 17:56.510
That queen who lost her state

17:56.510 --> 17:57.910
is a lesson from the past.

17:58.640 --> 17:59.960
A marriage between us

18:00.640 --> 18:02.440
would not only
be disapproved by Grandmother

18:02.440 --> 18:06.950
♪ The biting cold wind
makes me stumble as I run ♪

18:02.750 --> 18:04.790
but also be unacceptable
to the Rong ancestors.

18:04.790 --> 18:06.640
You're about to marry someone else

18:06.640 --> 18:07.920
and you still expect me to obey you?

18:06.970 --> 18:11.370
♪ Laughing innocently,
I find my spirit broken ♪

18:08.720 --> 18:10.450
Rong Shanbao, I'm telling you.

18:10.880 --> 18:12.480
If you truly dare to break your word

18:11.630 --> 18:14.040
♪ Just like this,
I'm drunk in a spring night ♪

18:12.480 --> 18:13.640
and marry that Yan Bailou,

18:13.640 --> 18:14.590
I'll make you taste

18:14.080 --> 18:16.720
♪ Just like this,
I'm lost in enduring hardships ♪

18:15.110 --> 18:16.480
what real defiance is.

18:16.930 --> 18:19.500
♪ Intertwined with you ♪

18:17.110 --> 18:17.790
What you care about most

18:17.790 --> 18:19.520
is your tea plantation, isn't it?

18:19.520 --> 18:23.780
♪ No longer fret over who loves more ♪

18:19.550 --> 18:20.440
I have plenty of ways

18:20.440 --> 18:21.680
to destroy your tea plantation

18:21.680 --> 18:23.440
and prevent your tea caravan
from leaving Linji!

18:23.440 --> 18:24.590
Since you know well I'm not

18:23.800 --> 18:28.370
♪ Gradually rid myself
of the snakes and scorpions in my heart ♪

18:24.590 --> 18:25.480
the obedient type,

18:25.480 --> 18:26.810
you should understand:

18:27.510 --> 18:28.400
I, Lu Jianglai,

18:28.400 --> 18:29.640
will never give away my lover

18:29.130 --> 18:32.330
♪ Drink a cup
filled with bold passion ♪

18:29.640 --> 18:31.400
I won with my life to anyone else!

18:31.400 --> 18:32.550
Whoever dares to take you from me

18:32.360 --> 18:36.180
♪ Sing a line
about lovebirds and butterflies ♪

18:32.880 --> 18:33.880
becomes my enemy!

18:34.030 --> 18:35.000
Let him try!

18:36.620 --> 18:40.180
♪ Put an end to all karmic ties and sins ♪

18:37.070 --> 18:38.310
You dare interfere with my affairs?

18:38.310 --> 18:39.640
You abandoned me first!

18:41.920 --> 18:42.880
I used to laugh at Rong Yunshu

18:42.880 --> 18:44.720
for being with a troublesome scholar,

18:44.720 --> 18:47.030
but it turns out
the most troublesome one is right here.

18:47.030 --> 18:48.120
You want closure?

18:49.310 --> 18:51.510
Fine, I'll give you that.

18:53.490 --> 18:58.000
♪ The biting cold wind
makes me stumble as I run ♪

18:58.020 --> 19:02.420
♪ Laughing innocently,
I find my spirit broken ♪

19:02.670 --> 19:05.090
♪ Just like this,
I'm drunk in a spring night ♪

19:05.130 --> 19:07.770
♪ Just like this,
I'm lost in enduring hardships ♪

19:07.980 --> 19:10.550
♪ Intertwined with you ♪

19:10.570 --> 19:14.830
♪ No longer fret over who loves more ♪

19:14.850 --> 19:19.420
♪ Gradually rid myself
of the snakes and scorpions in my heart ♪

19:20.180 --> 19:23.380
♪ Drink a cup
filled with bold passion ♪

19:23.410 --> 19:27.230
♪ Sing a line
about lovebirds and butterflies ♪

19:27.670 --> 19:31.230
♪ Put an end to all karmic ties and sins ♪

19:35.920 --> 19:40.190
♪ The biting cold wind
makes me stumble as I run ♪

19:40.220 --> 19:44.610
♪ Laughing innocently,
I find my spirit broken ♪

19:45.100 --> 19:47.530
♪ Just like this,
I'm drunk in a spring night ♪

19:47.560 --> 19:50.200
♪ Just like this,
I'm lost in enduring hardships ♪

19:50.220 --> 19:52.800
♪ Intertwined with you ♪

19:52.860 --> 19:57.110
♪ No longer fret over who loves more ♪

19:57.140 --> 20:01.700
♪ Gradually rid myself
of the snakes and scorpions in my heart ♪

20:02.350 --> 20:05.450
♪ Drink a cup
filled with bold passion ♪

20:05.480 --> 20:09.290
♪ Sing a line
about lovebirds and butterflies ♪

20:09.840 --> 20:13.390
♪ Put an end to all karmic ties and sins ♪

20:34.480 --> 20:35.270
Bao.

20:43.590 --> 20:44.240
Bao?

20:52.590 --> 20:54.180
Bao. Rong Shanbao!

20:54.750 --> 20:55.750
Open the door now!

20:56.030 --> 20:56.680
Lady Shanbao

20:56.680 --> 20:58.160
has already left before dawn.

20:58.160 --> 20:59.090
Where did she go?

20:59.460 --> 21:00.560
Today is Lady Shanbao's

21:00.560 --> 21:01.390
wedding day.

21:01.680 --> 21:02.510
To prevent you

21:02.510 --> 21:04.400
from doing something inappropriate,

21:04.400 --> 21:05.830
please bear with this

21:06.160 --> 21:08.200
and stay here until sunrise tomorrow.

21:08.200 --> 21:08.930
How dare she!

21:09.510 --> 21:10.570
Guard him properly

21:10.880 --> 21:12.430
and release him at cockcrow tomorrow.

21:12.430 --> 21:12.910
Yes.

21:13.070 --> 21:13.960
Open the door!

21:16.200 --> 21:16.750
Open up!

21:19.680 --> 21:21.240
What a heartless woman.

21:25.110 --> 21:26.160
What are you doing?

21:26.160 --> 21:27.240
Shanbao told me to keep an eye on you

21:27.240 --> 21:28.770
and make sure you work hard.

21:44.390 --> 21:45.250
Please come in.

21:46.880 --> 21:48.870
[Rong Mansion]

21:56.070 --> 21:56.930
Please come in.

21:57.160 --> 21:58.160
This way, please.

22:35.030 --> 22:35.830
Lady Shanbao,

22:36.550 --> 22:37.790
Old Madam and all the young ladies

22:37.790 --> 22:39.790
are waiting in the ancestral hall
for the ceremony.

22:39.790 --> 22:41.400
The guests have already been seated.

22:41.400 --> 22:43.070
After the ritual is completed,

22:43.070 --> 22:45.330
you'll toast the guests at their tables.

22:47.380 --> 22:48.010
Let's go.

23:10.640 --> 23:11.910
[Wei Yao Kill Me]

23:13.350 --> 23:14.160
Mr. Lang.

23:17.070 --> 23:17.720
Wake up.

23:17.830 --> 23:18.510
Wake up now.

23:18.870 --> 23:19.590
Take a look.

23:25.440 --> 23:25.960
Jun Dai!

23:26.200 --> 23:26.750
Mr. Lang.

23:27.040 --> 23:27.970
Where is Lord Lu?

23:28.070 --> 23:28.790
Where is he?

23:29.030 --> 23:30.240
He went to the tea mountain last night.

23:30.240 --> 23:32.110
Prepare the horse. I need to get
to the tea mountain right away.

23:32.110 --> 23:32.640
Yes.

23:33.360 --> 23:34.490
Get some capable men

23:34.490 --> 23:35.560
to go with Mr. Lang.

23:50.980 --> 23:53.630
[Rong's Ancestral Temple]

23:56.270 --> 23:57.070
Young Master.

24:00.850 --> 24:03.050
Indeed, good news brings high spirits.

24:03.400 --> 24:05.160
Being able to marry Shanbao smoothly

24:05.160 --> 24:07.110
has made Mr. Yan,
despite his unhealed body,

24:07.110 --> 24:07.680
forget all his pain

24:07.680 --> 24:08.960
completely.

24:09.270 --> 24:11.070
Lady Shanbao suggested postponing,

24:11.070 --> 24:12.720
but he insisted on proceeding as scheduled

24:12.720 --> 24:13.920
despite his illness.

24:14.040 --> 24:16.440
He must be so afraid
she'll change her mind.

24:18.680 --> 24:20.140
Lady Shanbao has arrived!

24:49.560 --> 24:50.360
Grandmother.

25:00.160 --> 25:02.490
Our Rong family is different from others.

25:02.710 --> 25:05.040
We don't follow those elaborate rituals.

25:05.350 --> 25:07.350
When a Rong woman chooses her match,

25:07.640 --> 25:08.510
the couple only needs

25:08.510 --> 25:09.970
to go to the paired pillars

25:10.110 --> 25:12.040
and make vows of eternal devotion,

25:12.400 --> 25:13.550
receiving the blessings

25:13.550 --> 25:15.200
of the Rong ancestors.

25:16.000 --> 25:18.480
From then on, they become a wedded pair.

25:28.550 --> 25:29.310
Mr. Yan,

25:30.540 --> 25:32.780
our Rong family worships
heaven, earth, and nature,

25:32.780 --> 25:34.710
believing all things have spirit.

25:34.960 --> 25:36.160
These paired pillars

25:36.750 --> 25:38.030
were originally two ancient trees

25:38.030 --> 25:39.000
on a steep cliff.

25:39.770 --> 25:42.030
They've endured
thousands of years of weathering.

25:42.030 --> 25:44.400
Legend says they can
connect heaven, earth, and spirits,

25:44.400 --> 25:46.350
and possess great spiritual power.

25:46.350 --> 25:47.950
The ground beneath your feet

25:48.200 --> 25:48.960
is especially blessed by

25:48.960 --> 25:50.750
generations of Rong ancestors.

25:50.750 --> 25:52.210
Anyone who makes vows here

25:52.770 --> 25:55.560
must clear their mind and pray sincerely.

25:56.480 --> 25:59.010
There must not
be the slightest concealment.

25:59.340 --> 26:02.030
Otherwise, the oath will backfire.

26:02.790 --> 26:05.550
Heaven, earth, and ancestors
will not tolerate it.

26:05.550 --> 26:06.240
Mr. Yan,

26:07.280 --> 26:08.880
have you thought it through?

26:09.150 --> 26:11.150
Are you truly taking your vows here?

26:11.440 --> 26:12.900
My heart is open and clear,

26:13.160 --> 26:14.360
with nothing to hide.

26:14.730 --> 26:16.930
What oath could I possibly fear to take?

26:17.240 --> 26:18.040
Rest assured,

26:18.720 --> 26:20.240
I will never be like others

26:20.790 --> 26:22.250
who deceive and cheat you.

26:25.090 --> 26:27.220
Then let's proceed with the ceremony.

26:27.720 --> 26:29.450
First, kneel to the ancestors.

27:14.750 --> 27:16.610
Grandmother, the incense broke.

27:16.700 --> 27:17.390
Silence!

27:18.130 --> 27:19.060
Broken incense.

27:19.440 --> 27:20.680
This is inauspicious.

27:20.680 --> 27:21.240
Indeed.

27:21.240 --> 27:22.440
It's a bad omen.

27:54.640 --> 27:57.370
In our Rong family,
women hold the primary place.

27:57.400 --> 27:58.590
Only you bow to her.

27:58.850 --> 28:00.200
She doesn't bow to you.

28:01.880 --> 28:02.600
Alright.

28:03.160 --> 28:04.480
Mr. Yan hasn't fully recovered.

28:04.480 --> 28:05.640
He shouldn't stand for long.

28:05.640 --> 28:07.460
Dispense with the remaining rituals.

28:07.460 --> 28:09.990
Once they make their vows
before the pillars,

28:10.590 --> 28:13.060
they shall be husband and wife.

28:28.870 --> 28:29.630
Shanbao.

28:32.750 --> 28:33.480
Shanbao.

29:02.070 --> 29:03.130
Stop the ceremony!

29:24.410 --> 29:25.340
Why are you here?

29:25.720 --> 29:28.270
Lord Lu,
what great official authority you have,

29:28.270 --> 29:29.700
barging into our ancestral hall

29:29.700 --> 29:32.160
with your men, disregarding all propriety.

29:32.350 --> 29:33.440
It seems you

29:33.440 --> 29:35.040
have no respect for me at all.

29:35.120 --> 29:36.030
The situation is urgent,

29:36.030 --> 29:37.230
so I had to act rashly.

29:37.350 --> 29:39.280
I beg your forgiveness, Old Madam.

29:39.820 --> 29:41.080
If I hadn't come today,

29:41.510 --> 29:42.890
I'm afraid the Rong family

29:42.890 --> 29:43.760
would likely take in

29:43.760 --> 29:45.920
a heinous criminal suspect.

29:45.940 --> 29:46.530
Lord Lu,

29:47.070 --> 29:49.000
Young Master has never offended you.

29:49.000 --> 29:50.940
How can you falsely
accuse him of such crimes?

29:50.940 --> 29:51.580
Shixin.

29:55.440 --> 29:56.120
Lord Lu,

29:58.030 --> 29:59.430
if this is about Shanbao,

29:59.960 --> 30:01.200
it is indeed my fault.

30:02.880 --> 30:03.790
Your resentment

30:03.790 --> 30:04.920
is understandable.

30:05.480 --> 30:07.480
But this is a sacred ancestral hall.

30:07.590 --> 30:09.480
You cannot make false accusations here

30:09.480 --> 30:10.740
and implicate others.

30:11.640 --> 30:12.400
Mr. Yan.

30:13.750 --> 30:14.240
No,

30:15.440 --> 30:16.270
I misspoke.

30:16.920 --> 30:18.180
You're not Yan Bailou.

30:20.270 --> 30:20.880
Guards!

30:21.550 --> 30:23.150
Bring in the real Yan Bailou.

30:46.250 --> 30:47.880
This man looks terrifying.

30:49.670 --> 30:50.730
Who is this person?

30:51.150 --> 30:52.350
Look at his face.

30:53.530 --> 30:54.460
It's horrifying

30:54.480 --> 30:55.810
This is too disturbing.

31:01.640 --> 31:02.920
He has no tongue!

31:05.130 --> 31:06.250
Who is he?

31:06.790 --> 31:08.790
He... he has no tongue?

31:09.820 --> 31:11.710
Where did Lord Lu find

31:11.920 --> 31:13.000
a mute man

31:13.070 --> 31:14.400
with crippled limbs?

31:14.920 --> 31:17.180
And claims he's the son of the Yan family?

31:17.200 --> 31:19.200
How could he possibly be Yan Bailou?

31:22.470 --> 31:24.220
[Wei Yao killed me]

31:47.680 --> 31:49.160
Wei Yao killed me?

31:49.920 --> 31:50.960
Who is Wei Yao?

31:51.680 --> 31:52.750
And who is "me"?

31:53.680 --> 31:54.350
Wei Yao

31:55.480 --> 31:56.030
is the eldest son

31:56.030 --> 31:57.440
left by Wei Kejian's

31:57.640 --> 31:58.640
first wife.

31:59.480 --> 32:01.010
Mrs. Wei passed away early,

32:01.640 --> 32:04.300
and then Madam Yang
married into the Wei family.

32:05.070 --> 32:07.160
The handwriting
on this paper is illegible.

32:07.160 --> 32:08.480
I've organized the information.

32:08.480 --> 32:09.880
Let me tell you directly.

32:10.920 --> 32:13.450
Mr. Yan was traveling
from Shu region to Linji

32:14.200 --> 32:15.160
when he met

32:15.160 --> 32:16.550
a lone scholar on the way.

32:16.550 --> 32:18.950
The two hit it off
and became close friends.

32:18.960 --> 32:19.790
This scholar

32:20.270 --> 32:22.790
claimed he was going to Linji
to find relatives.

32:22.790 --> 32:25.070
Mr. Yan kindly invited him
to travel together.

32:25.070 --> 32:26.960
They journeyed
through mountains and rivers.

32:26.960 --> 32:28.160
Passing near Guzhou,

32:28.750 --> 32:31.200
the scholar, claiming to know a shortcut,

32:31.270 --> 32:33.130
led everyone into a dense forest.

32:33.960 --> 32:36.550
Seven or eight servants,
completely unprepared,

32:36.550 --> 32:39.010
were brutally murdered
by bandits at night.

32:39.480 --> 32:42.000
Thanks to a servant
sacrificing his life to protect him,

32:42.000 --> 32:43.330
Mr. Yan and that scholar

32:44.030 --> 32:45.240
managed to escape.

32:46.130 --> 32:48.240
But he never expected...

32:50.890 --> 32:51.610
Stop!

32:51.860 --> 32:52.490
Stop!

32:53.510 --> 32:54.790
Hurry! Over there!

32:55.370 --> 32:56.090
Stop!

32:56.510 --> 32:57.310
Just ahead!

32:57.480 --> 32:59.070
Trying to run? Kill him!

32:59.350 --> 33:00.680
Wei, don't mind me.

33:00.700 --> 33:01.430
You go first.

33:03.870 --> 33:04.960
You're too kind, Yan.

33:04.960 --> 33:05.440
Hurry!

33:05.720 --> 33:07.200
You go ahead instead.

33:08.110 --> 33:09.030
Over here!

33:10.840 --> 33:11.560
Stop!

33:12.240 --> 33:12.830
Stop!

33:16.030 --> 33:16.920
I'll make sure

33:17.430 --> 33:19.630
that even on the road to the underworld,

33:19.690 --> 33:22.660
he can't speak, can't write,

33:23.240 --> 33:24.970
and can't plead his injustice.

33:26.140 --> 33:28.140
The bandits thought he was dead

33:28.550 --> 33:30.790
so they threw his body into a ravine.

33:31.510 --> 33:33.070
But it wasn't his time to die.

33:33.070 --> 33:34.400
Despite being crippled,

33:34.400 --> 33:35.400
he survived.

33:35.750 --> 33:37.610
Thanks to the help of kind people,

33:37.720 --> 33:39.480
he begged his way to Linji.

33:40.440 --> 33:41.920
With just a few scribbles

33:42.400 --> 33:43.790
and no useful evidence,

33:44.490 --> 33:46.250
you want to condemn me.

33:47.270 --> 33:48.750
How arbitrary and absurd!

33:49.400 --> 33:50.080
Lord Lu,

33:50.450 --> 33:52.580
I've always respected your character

33:52.960 --> 33:54.300
and treated you with sincerity.

33:54.300 --> 33:55.780
Even if you're jealous

33:56.030 --> 33:57.920
and deliberately obstructing our marriage,

33:57.920 --> 33:58.480
you shouldn't use

33:58.480 --> 33:59.810
such despicable means.

34:00.880 --> 34:02.240
Once this spreads,

34:02.450 --> 34:04.200
it will surely invite ridicule.

34:04.200 --> 34:06.600
What good will that do
for your reputation?

34:11.190 --> 34:11.989
Grandmother,

34:12.320 --> 34:13.280
I've been in the Rong Mansion

34:13.280 --> 34:14.440
for quite some time now.

34:14.440 --> 34:15.150
Who I am

34:15.150 --> 34:16.590
and what my character is like—

34:16.590 --> 34:17.670
can a stranger

34:17.760 --> 34:19.090
so easily tarnish that?

34:19.960 --> 34:20.920
I will immediately send someone

34:20.920 --> 34:22.110
to ride swiftly back to Shu region

34:22.110 --> 34:24.360
to find members from the Yan family
to verify my identity.

34:24.360 --> 34:26.620
But I cannot tolerate this humiliation.

34:27.320 --> 34:28.780
Please grant me some trust

34:29.670 --> 34:30.400
and drive out

34:31.000 --> 34:33.600
all these disrupters
of the wedding ceremony.

34:34.630 --> 34:36.150
Don't let me lose face

34:36.920 --> 34:38.520
and become a laughingstock.

34:40.360 --> 34:41.840
No need for your pretense.

34:42.440 --> 34:43.670
I've already sent people

34:43.670 --> 34:45.710
to Guzhou where the Yan family
met with misfortune.

34:45.710 --> 34:47.800
The Yan family home
will naturally be visited.

34:47.800 --> 34:49.130
But the journey is long.

34:49.480 --> 34:50.810
Old Madam, I request you

34:50.840 --> 34:52.510
to grant me time for verification.

34:52.510 --> 34:53.560
So,

34:54.000 --> 34:55.659
apart from this man's testimony,

34:55.659 --> 34:57.390
you have no other evidence.

34:57.880 --> 34:58.840
Then do not interrupt

34:58.840 --> 35:00.500
my granddaughter's wedding.

35:01.880 --> 35:03.510
Bailou, rise.

35:04.120 --> 35:05.370
I believe you.

35:09.160 --> 35:10.620
Young Master, be careful.

35:14.960 --> 35:15.760
Lady Shanbao,

35:16.480 --> 35:17.230
do you really

35:17.230 --> 35:18.360
believe these lies?

35:18.510 --> 35:19.280
They're conspiring to frame

35:19.280 --> 35:20.280
Young Master Yan.

35:20.800 --> 35:22.730
He would even risk his life for you.

35:22.920 --> 35:24.720
Such sincerity is beyond doubt.

35:24.880 --> 35:25.550
Shixin,

35:27.920 --> 35:29.980
how long have you served your master?

35:31.180 --> 35:34.190
Young Master Yan comes from
a renowned tea plantation family

35:34.190 --> 35:36.190
and has studied tea-making for 20 years.

35:36.190 --> 35:37.590
Yet his personal servant

35:37.750 --> 35:39.950
doesn't know how to plant tea cuttings.

35:40.380 --> 35:41.780
This doesn't make sense.

35:46.770 --> 35:48.100
I told you not to meddle.

35:48.590 --> 35:51.050
These cuttings need to be planted
at a slant.

35:51.800 --> 35:53.800
Although Mr. Yan claims that Shixin

35:53.840 --> 35:55.900
was a servant he took in along the way,

35:55.960 --> 35:57.360
I became suspicious

35:58.000 --> 36:00.070
and had someone investigate secretly.

36:00.070 --> 36:00.710
It turns out that the servants

36:00.710 --> 36:02.510
you brought into our Rong family

36:03.050 --> 36:03.710
are actually not

36:03.710 --> 36:05.110
from your own household.

36:07.960 --> 36:08.670
Shanbao,

36:09.630 --> 36:10.630
you doubt me?

36:11.360 --> 36:14.000
Since I spent years
at the top of Mount Meng

36:15.110 --> 36:17.150
where servants
weren't allowed in the temple,

36:17.150 --> 36:19.080
I handled everything personally.

36:19.400 --> 36:21.320
I originally had servants from my family,

36:21.320 --> 36:22.800
but they got dysentery
due to the unfamiliar climate

36:22.800 --> 36:24.260
and were sent back midway.

36:24.840 --> 36:26.590
That's why I hired new servants.

36:26.590 --> 36:29.280
Is this also considered
evidence of a crime?

36:31.110 --> 36:31.840
Is that so?

36:43.990 --> 36:45.100
Greetings, Old Madam

36:45.100 --> 36:46.100
and Lady Shanbao.

36:46.840 --> 36:48.440
Weren't you sent to Yinzhou?

36:48.840 --> 36:49.800
Why have you returned?

36:49.800 --> 36:51.390
Please forgive me, Old Madam.

36:51.390 --> 36:52.390
Before I left,

36:52.420 --> 36:53.550
Ms. Yan called for me

36:54.150 --> 36:56.550
and entrusted me with an important matter.

37:00.880 --> 37:01.740
Tie it tightly.

37:01.750 --> 37:02.310
Alright.

37:03.930 --> 37:05.130
Secure the water bag.

37:05.360 --> 37:05.880
Got it.

37:09.150 --> 37:10.810
Make sure it's done properly.

37:10.950 --> 37:11.590
Yes.

37:14.320 --> 37:15.650
I never went to Yinzhou.

37:16.360 --> 37:18.280
Instead, I went to
the Yan family in the Shu region

37:18.280 --> 37:19.940
to verify Mr. Yan's identity.

37:21.070 --> 37:23.030
And I've brought someone back with me.

37:23.030 --> 37:24.960
Old Madam, please take a close look.

37:24.960 --> 37:26.150
This is Yan Xiang

37:26.590 --> 37:27.360
who has been

37:27.360 --> 37:29.490
the Yan family's steward for 30 years.

37:42.960 --> 37:43.760
Young Master.

37:44.670 --> 37:45.480
Young Master!

37:46.230 --> 37:47.110
Young Master!

37:47.590 --> 37:48.670
Young Master!

37:48.930 --> 37:50.930
What happened to you?

37:52.150 --> 37:54.880
Who did this to you?

37:57.630 --> 37:58.280
You...

37:59.320 --> 38:00.120
Young Master!

38:21.800 --> 38:22.630
Liar.

38:24.480 --> 38:26.010
So from the very beginning,

38:26.670 --> 38:28.470
you were planning to capture me.

38:29.400 --> 38:30.200
That's right.

38:31.400 --> 38:32.110
I did take over

38:32.110 --> 38:33.440
Yan Bailou's identity.

38:34.150 --> 38:36.150
But since I came to the Rong Mansion,

38:36.150 --> 38:37.920
have I wronged you in any way?

38:38.550 --> 38:40.350
How could you treat me like this?

38:41.590 --> 38:42.840
You're still acting.

38:43.590 --> 38:45.710
You escaped from Linji
and hid your identity,

38:45.710 --> 38:47.710
patiently waiting for
a chance to take revenge.

38:47.710 --> 38:48.280
When you learned that

38:48.280 --> 38:49.840
the Rong family
was seeking a husband for Lady Shanbao,

38:49.840 --> 38:52.150
you deliberately
approached Yan Bailou mid-journey,

38:52.150 --> 38:53.110
befriended him,

38:53.670 --> 38:55.400
imitated his mannerisms,

38:55.800 --> 38:57.800
intentionally led him to his death,

38:58.480 --> 39:00.610
and then entered Linji under his name.

39:00.630 --> 39:01.480
Along the way, you took in

39:01.480 --> 39:02.340
a homeless boy,

39:02.590 --> 39:04.480
renamed him Shixin (means stone heart).

39:04.480 --> 39:05.670
"Though clothed in rags
and eating plain food,

39:05.670 --> 39:07.400
one may not die of hunger or cold;

39:07.400 --> 39:08.440
with a heart of stone and bowels of wood,

39:08.440 --> 39:09.510
one vows never forget
loyalty and righteousness."

39:09.510 --> 39:10.590
Yet what you've never forgotten

39:10.590 --> 39:11.920
is clearly your hatred!

39:13.320 --> 39:14.000
Yang Dingchen

39:14.000 --> 39:15.280
died by your hands.

39:16.150 --> 39:17.440
He's hidden it so well.

39:17.800 --> 39:18.710
Indeed.

39:24.670 --> 39:26.590
He Xingming has already
confessed to the murder.

39:26.590 --> 39:28.440
There's no need to fabricate more lies.

39:28.440 --> 39:29.030
When he entered,

39:29.030 --> 39:30.800
Yang Dingchen
was already having an attack.

39:30.800 --> 39:31.800
The servants said

39:32.130 --> 39:33.440
Yang Dingchen hadn't suffered

39:33.440 --> 39:34.760
from asthma for many years.

39:34.760 --> 39:36.070
You must have tampered with

39:36.070 --> 39:38.160
his incense burner
when no one was watching.

39:38.160 --> 39:39.050
He Xingming

39:39.080 --> 39:40.480
was just your scapegoat.

39:49.840 --> 39:53.800
Heaven's justice is clear.
Karma never fails.

39:54.550 --> 39:55.590
My Wei family suffered

39:55.590 --> 39:57.030
ten years of false accusations.

39:57.030 --> 39:57.960
Ten years!

39:58.670 --> 40:01.150
Countless innocent clan members
were convicted and exiled.

40:01.150 --> 40:03.430
If I hadn't been studying
in Yizhou at the time,

40:03.430 --> 40:05.560
I would have been imprisoned long ago.

40:05.800 --> 40:07.330
To pay for the Yang family's

40:07.960 --> 40:10.160
crimes with Yang Dingchen's life alone

40:11.190 --> 40:12.670
is already too lenient.

40:13.320 --> 40:14.580
What about Madam Yang?

40:15.320 --> 40:17.520
Your Wei family members were innocent,

40:17.550 --> 40:19.760
but does that mean
Madam Yang deserves to die?

40:19.760 --> 40:21.760
She never committed a single evil act,

40:21.760 --> 40:23.420
couldn't bear to harm anyone.

40:23.480 --> 40:24.150
Even though she suffered

40:24.150 --> 40:26.280
mistreatment from
her mother-in-law and husband,

40:26.280 --> 40:27.150
she was still willing to stand up

40:27.150 --> 40:28.940
and testify for your Wei family.

40:28.940 --> 40:29.870
All she asked for

40:30.440 --> 40:32.500
was to live out her days in the temple.

40:32.550 --> 40:34.320
Yet you still wouldn't let her be

40:34.320 --> 40:36.050
and had to push her to her death.

40:46.400 --> 40:47.800
She deserved to die.

40:53.110 --> 40:54.670
She was the source of hatred

40:54.670 --> 40:56.400
between the Wei and Yang families—

40:56.400 --> 40:57.760
a cursed woman.

40:58.920 --> 40:59.780
Because of her,

41:00.150 --> 41:01.440
the entire Wei family

41:01.880 --> 41:03.760
suffered countless hardships.

41:04.880 --> 41:07.140
She didn't deserve to live in this world!

41:10.280 --> 41:10.800
There were indeed

41:10.800 --> 41:13.530
innocent people
who suffered in your Wei family.

41:13.840 --> 41:15.920
But your grandmother
abused your stepmother,

41:15.920 --> 41:17.590
and your father turned a blind eye.

41:17.590 --> 41:18.030
He was

41:18.030 --> 41:20.340
the real source of all
family troubles and misfortunes.

41:20.340 --> 41:22.320
Instead of blaming
your grandmother for her severity

41:22.320 --> 41:23.670
or resenting your father
for his incompetence,

41:23.670 --> 41:25.320
or hating the Yang family
for their cruelty,

41:25.320 --> 41:26.580
you shift all the blame

41:26.660 --> 41:28.030
onto a powerless woman—

41:28.760 --> 41:30.800
clearly taking advantage of
her inability to fight back.

41:30.800 --> 41:32.600
How despicable and ridiculous.

41:33.150 --> 41:34.950
How dare you spout nonsense here

41:35.030 --> 41:36.230
and claim injustice?

41:36.360 --> 41:37.560
You don't deserve it!

41:38.070 --> 41:39.880
Bao, calm down.

41:40.150 --> 41:41.350
Don't hurt yourself.

41:42.370 --> 41:43.370
He's not worth it.

41:43.400 --> 41:44.030
Ask him.

41:44.510 --> 41:45.150
Ask him.

41:45.710 --> 41:47.280
Why did he enter the Rong family

41:47.280 --> 41:48.880
under false pretenses?

41:50.510 --> 41:51.150
Wei Yao,

41:51.960 --> 41:54.000
you repeatedly tried
to get close to me before

41:54.000 --> 41:55.440
just to lower my guard.

41:56.110 --> 41:58.030
You used me to suppress

41:58.030 --> 41:59.890
Wen Can, He Xingming, and others.

41:59.960 --> 42:01.840
After I gained Lady Shanbao's favor,

42:01.840 --> 42:03.000
you revealed my true identity

42:03.000 --> 42:04.460
in front of the Rong family

42:04.840 --> 42:06.440
to win Old Madam's approval

42:06.910 --> 42:08.510
and become the final winner.

42:08.790 --> 42:11.390
You've been hiding
in the Rong family for days.

42:11.970 --> 42:12.710
Could it be that you

42:12.710 --> 42:14.000
consider Lady Shanbao,
who helped Madam Yang,

42:14.000 --> 42:15.150
as your enemy too

42:15.590 --> 42:18.120
and intend to take revenge
on the Rong family?

42:18.150 --> 42:19.030
Lu Jianglai,

42:19.880 --> 42:20.760
you've figured out

42:20.760 --> 42:22.420
my intentions so thoroughly.

42:22.880 --> 42:24.280
But you're wrong about one thing:

42:24.280 --> 42:26.190
my feelings for Lady Shanbao.

42:27.220 --> 42:28.310
At this point,

42:28.960 --> 42:30.190
are you still trying

42:30.190 --> 42:31.150
to slander me?

42:31.630 --> 42:33.360
You're already a puddle of mud.

42:34.440 --> 42:36.170
There's no need to slander you.

42:41.030 --> 42:41.840
Rong Shanbao,

42:43.030 --> 42:44.280
what I told you before

42:45.320 --> 42:46.850
about running for our lives

42:48.400 --> 42:49.280
is true.

42:52.400 --> 42:53.030
You

42:54.000 --> 42:55.000
don't deserve it.

43:00.960 --> 43:01.670
Yes.

43:03.630 --> 43:05.230
I don't deserve it.

43:06.710 --> 43:07.840
With my power alone,

43:08.400 --> 43:11.260
reviving the fallen Wei family
would be difficult.

43:12.280 --> 43:12.800
But with

43:12.800 --> 43:15.130
the position of the Rong family's master,

43:16.070 --> 43:18.400
it would be as easy as
turning my hand over.

43:20.630 --> 43:23.030
It's all because this nuisance didn't die.

43:23.590 --> 43:26.520
Otherwise, with the Yan family
far away in Shu region

43:27.400 --> 43:29.130
and communication difficult,

43:29.280 --> 43:30.800
after a year or so,

43:32.400 --> 43:34.150
when the Rong family's descendants

43:34.150 --> 43:35.840
carried Wei blood,

43:36.070 --> 43:36.930
could you still

43:38.360 --> 43:40.400
kill me and the child?

43:43.880 --> 43:44.760
I'm afraid you'll never

43:44.760 --> 43:46.510
get that chance in this lifetime.

43:46.510 --> 43:47.310
Take him away!

43:51.920 --> 43:52.510
Go!

44:16.670 --> 44:17.470
Grandmother.

44:19.920 --> 44:21.320
Escort me back to my room.

47:05.050 --> 47:07.570
[Alternative Ways to Drink Tea]

47:08.620 --> 47:09.480
Rong Yunxi!

47:10.940 --> 47:11.940
Think carefully.

47:12.710 --> 47:14.110
If you dare keep him here,

47:14.630 --> 47:16.440
you'll never get a share

47:17.230 --> 47:19.890
of the Rong family's
tea plantations and shops.

47:20.400 --> 47:21.500
Without relying on the Rong family,

47:21.500 --> 47:23.900
we need to think of
other ways to make money.

47:24.130 --> 47:25.060
I have an idea.

47:25.810 --> 47:27.940
Let's make innovative cold-brew tea.

47:28.800 --> 47:29.590
Nowadays in summer,

47:29.590 --> 47:31.320
everyone loves cold-brew tea.

47:31.480 --> 47:33.280
Actually, the history of cold-brew tea

47:33.280 --> 47:35.410
can be traced back to the Song Dynasty.

47:35.590 --> 47:38.050
During that era of
flourishing tea culture,

47:38.110 --> 47:40.030
a scholar named He Dexiu

47:40.440 --> 47:42.550
poured ice cubes over tea leaves,

47:42.800 --> 47:44.000
inventing iced tea.

47:44.190 --> 47:45.320
The Song Dynasty also had

47:45.320 --> 47:46.760
a tea-and-pastry

47:46.760 --> 47:48.760
combination called Yulin Tea,

47:49.280 --> 47:50.840
made by carving candied winter melon

47:50.840 --> 47:52.760
into different hollow shapes

47:53.000 --> 47:54.070
before adding it to tea—

47:54.070 --> 47:55.550
both tasty and fun.

47:56.320 --> 47:57.150
By the Ming Dynasty,

47:57.150 --> 47:59.030
various fruit teas and dried fruit teas

47:59.030 --> 48:00.890
became popular among the people,

48:01.390 --> 48:02.520
like walnut and pine nut tea,

48:02.520 --> 48:04.080
candied kumquat tea,

48:04.150 --> 48:05.800
salted bamboo shoot,
sesame and osmanthus tea,

48:05.800 --> 48:07.190
osmanthus and green bean tea,

48:07.190 --> 48:08.440
osmanthus and kumquat tea,

48:08.440 --> 48:09.670
salted cherry tea, etc.

48:09.670 --> 48:11.320
One could say there were
hundreds of tea flavors

48:11.320 --> 48:12.360
and hundreds of tastes.
